  "name": "Lucky Strike",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You influence your luck as you go into the offensive. You @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.hsCJT2h2dgISso8T]{Play Card}, and then Strike. The suit of the card affects the properties of your strike:</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\"><strong>Strength/Dexterity</strong>: Your Strike ignores your multi-attack penalty.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><strong>Constitution/Wisdom</strong>: Your Strike ignores the target’s resistances and hardness.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><strong>Intelligence/Charisma</strong>: Your Strike triggers a critical hit on a 19 on your attack roll if it would be a success. If your weapon has the effects of a Keen rune or a similar effect, you trigger a critical hit on an 18 instead.</p></li></ul>"
